# Clerestory proof for the emission channel: one 8x8 open module walled in
# panes of stained glass on tileset 14. The nave is kept dim (a single low
# brazier) so the glass reads by its own glow, not reflected torchlight. The
# floor and vault are the cathedral stone; only the walls are emissive glass.
map GLASSHALL
size 24 24
tileset 14
music 0
sector 0 0 128
walls
